 * {{Symbol|Attack Modifier}}
** Saltwater Shiv is an active attack modifier, and has the following properties:
*** {{cf|expr}} {{Code|[[Cast Range|CastRange]] {{=}} Hero[[Attack Range|AtkRange]]}}
*** Affected by {{M|attack range}} sources of the same range-type as the caster.
** Both {{M|Autocast}} and an active cast uses Slark's current {{M|attack range}}.
*** Has Autocast off by default.
** {{Symbol|Attack Damage|Instant}}
*** This ability component is not applied by [[instant attack]] sources.

* {{Symbol|Modifier|Buff}} {{Code|slark_saltwater_shiv_effect (x)}} and {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|slark_saltwater_shiv_effect (x)}}
** Both the enemy reduction and self-gain component stacks and functions independently of each other.
** Reapplying the modifier applies another indepedent instance.
** Both modifiers consider {{M|clones}} and the {{H|Spirit Bear}} as heroes; {{M|illusions}} and other {{M|creep-heroes}} as creeps.

* The ability effects are applied as follows per successful attack:
**# {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|slark_saltwater_shiv_effect (x)}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
**#* Applies a {{M|health restoration}} reduction, flat {{M|health regeneration}} reduction, and flat {{M|movement speed}} reduction on the debuff-affected enemy hero.
**#* Cannot reduce the health restoration value and health regeneration value below 0.
**#* Cannot reduce movement speed value below {{G|movement speed min}}
**#* {{Symbol|Dispel|Any}}
**#** Restores the enemy's affected values to the original values upon [[dispelling]] the debuff.
**#** Does not affect Slark's buff.
**# {{Symbol|Modifier|Buff}} {{Code|slark_saltwater_shiv_effect (x)}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
**#* Grants bonus health restoration amplification, flat health regeneration bonus, and flat movement speed bonus.
**#* {{Symbol|Dispel|Any}}
**#** Dispelling the buff on Slark does not affect the debuff applied on the affected enemy unit.
**# Applies {{A|Slark|Essence Shift}} of its corresponding level.
**# Slark's attack instance.

