 * Acquiring {{M|Aghanim's Shard}} unlocks this ability in the {{Spellslot|4|5}}.

* [[File:Dota2 Cast Range to AoE Visualization icon-2-1.png|84px]][[File:Dota2 Cast Range to AoE Visualization icon-2-2.png|84px]]
** Can affect allied units at max {{Symbol|bonus cas}} {{Symbol|bonus aoe}} {{#expr:{{#var:Depth Shroud cast range}}+{{#var:Depth Shroud value1}}}}-distance away with the [[cast range]] and [[effect radius]].

* {{Symbol|Aura}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Modifier|Buff}} {{Code|slark_depth_shroud}}
** Creates an independent [[aura]] at the {{Symbol|Target|Area}} area-targeted location upon cast. Hence, sources that usually disable the {{A|Slark|Shadow Dance}} ability components do not affect Depth Shroud.
** Applies the following ability components within the aura radius:
*** {{M|Invisibility}} with {{M|True Sight immunity}}.
**** Can be revealed by the following sources:
***** {{A|Gem of True Sight|Reveal}}
***** {{A|Grimstroke|Ink Trail}}
***** {{A|Nyx Assassin|Nyxth Sense}}
***** {{A|Tusk|Snowball}}
*** {{M|Health regeneration}} bonus.
*** {{M|Movement speed}} bonus.
*** {{Symbol|bonus t3l}} Flat bonus {{M|attack speed}}.
** Does not affect the following allied units:
*** {{M|Buildings}}
*** {{M|Hidden}} units.
*** {{M|Invulnerable}} units.
*** {{M|Ward-type units}}

* {{Symbol|Target|Area-Inter}}
** Multiple overlapping Depth Shroud radius do not stack.

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Depth Shroud icon0}}
| desc = Creates a cloud at the target location. All allies inside the radius are hidden and affected by Shadow Dance.
}}
* Directly uses {{A|Slark|Shadow Dance}}'s ability values, it does nothing if Shadow Dance is not learned upon cast.

* {{Symbol|Aura}}
** Has a {{#var:Depth Shroud value3}}-second aura linger duration due to the {{M|server tick}} limit, despite the duration being set as {{#var:Depth Shroud basic1}} seconds in the backend ability files.

